---

<main class="terms-root">
	<section class="terms-card">
		<header class="terms-header">
			<h1 class="terms-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="terms-meta">Last updated: 2025</p>
		</header>

		<div class="terms-scroll">
			<!-- 1. CONTROLLER -->
			<section class="terms-section">
				<h2 class="terms-heading">1. Data controller</h2>
				<p>
					The data controller responsible for processing your personal data is <strong>Numen Games S.L.</strong>
					("Numen", "we", "us", or "our"), a Spanish limited liability company. You may contact us at
					<strong>legal@numengames.com</strong> for any privacy-related matter.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- 2. DATA COLLECTED -->
			<section class="terms-section">
				<h2 class="terms-heading">2. Personal data we collect</h2>
				<p>We collect the following categories of personal data through our Website:</p>
				<ul class="terms-list">
					<li>
						<strong>Contact and identification data:</strong> first name, last name, email address,
						company name, and any other information you voluntarily provide through our contact or
						demo request forms.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Communications data:</strong> the content of messages, project descriptions,
						or queries you submit through the Website.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Technical and navigation data:</strong> IP address, browser type and version,
						operating system, referring URLs, pages visited, and time spent — collected
						automatically through cookies and analytics tools.
					</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					We do not intentionally collect sensitive personal data (such as health data, racial or
					ethnic origin, or political opinions). Please refrain from including such data in your
					communications with us.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- 3. PURPOSES AND LEGAL BASES -->
			<section class="terms-section">
				<h2 class="terms-heading">3. Purposes and legal bases for processing</h2>

				<h3 class="terms-subheading">3.1 Responding to contact and demo requests</h3>
				<p>
					We process your data to respond to your inquiries and arrange demos or presentations of
					our Services. The legal basis is the execution of pre-contractual measures at your
					request (Article 6(1)(b) GDPR).
				</p>

				<h3 class="terms-subheading">3.2 Managing commercial relationships</h3>
				<p>
					If you become a client or partner, we process your data to manage the commercial
					relationship, issue proposals and invoices, and deliver our Services. The legal basis is
					the performance of a contract (Article 6(1)(b) GDPR) and compliance with legal
					obligations (Article 6(1)(c) GDPR).
				</p>

				<h3 class="terms-subheading">3.3 Sending commercial communications</h3>
				<p>
					Where you have provided your consent or where permitted by applicable law, we may send
					you information about our services, news, or events. The legal basis is consent
					(Article 6(1)(a) GDPR) or legitimate interest (Article 6(1)(f) GDPR). You may
					withdraw consent or object at any time by contacting us at <strong>legal@numengames.com</strong>.
				</p>

				<h3 class="terms-subheading">3.4 Website analytics and improvement</h3>
				<p>
					We use analytics tools to understand how visitors interact with our Website and to
					improve its performance. The legal basis is our legitimate interest (Article 6(1)(f)
					GDPR) in operating and improving our online presence. Where required, we obtain your
					prior consent through our cookie consent mechanism.
				</p>

				<h3 class="terms-subheading">3.5 Legal compliance</h3>
				<p>
					We may process your data to comply with applicable legal obligations, including tax,
					accounting, and data protection law. The legal basis is compliance with a legal
					obligation (Article 6(1)(c) GDPR).
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- 4. DATA RETENTION -->
			<section class="terms-section">
				<h2 class="terms-heading">4. Data retention</h2>
				<p>We retain your personal data for as long as necessary for the purposes described above:</p>
				<ul class="terms-list">
					<li>
						<strong>Contact and demo requests:</strong> up to 3 years from the last interaction,
						unless a contractual relationship is established.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Client data:</strong> for the duration of the contractual relationship plus
						the statutory limitation periods under Spanish law (generally 5 years for contractual
						claims).
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Commercial communications:</strong> until you withdraw your consent or object.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Analytics data:</strong> in accordance with the retention periods set by
						the relevant analytics tool (see our Cookie Policy for details).
					</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<!-- 5. DATA RECIPIENTS -->
			<section class="terms-section">
				<h2 class="terms-heading">5. Recipients and international transfers</h2>
				<p>
					We do not sell your personal data. We may share your data with trusted third-party
					service providers acting as data processors on our behalf, including:
				</p>
				<ul class="terms-list">
					<li>cloud hosting and infrastructure providers;</li>
					<li>CRM and project management platforms;</li>
					<li>email and communication service providers;</li>
					<li>analytics and marketing tools.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					All processors are bound by data processing agreements ensuring compliance with the
					GDPR. Where data is transferred outside the European Economic Area (EEA), we ensure
					appropriate safeguards are in place, such as Standard Contractual Clauses approved by
					the European Commission.
				</p>
				<p>
					We may also disclose your data to public authorities, courts, or law enforcement bodies
					when required by applicable law.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- 6. YOUR RIGHTS -->
			<section class="terms-section">
				<h2 class="terms-heading">6. Your rights</h2>
				<p>
					Under the GDPR and the Spanish Organic Law on Data Protection (LOPDGDD), you have the
					following rights regarding your personal data:
				</p>
				<ul class="terms-list">
					<li><strong>Right of access:</strong> to obtain confirmation of whether we process your data and a copy thereof.</li>
					<li><strong>Right to rectification:</strong> to request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
					<li><strong>Right to erasure:</strong> to request deletion of your data when it is no longer necessary.</li>
					<li><strong>Right to restriction:</strong> to request that we limit the processing of your data in certain circumstances.</li>
					<li><strong>Right to data portability:</strong> to receive your data in a structured, machine-readable format.</li>
					<li><strong>Right to object:</strong> to oppose processing based on our legitimate interests, including direct marketing.</li>
					<li><strong>Right to withdraw consent:</strong> where processing is based on consent, to withdraw it at any time without affecting prior processing.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <strong>legal@numengames.com</strong>.
					We will respond within 30 days. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the
					Spanish Data Protection Authority (AEPD, <strong>www.aepd.es</strong>) or your local
					supervisory authority.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- 7. SECURITY -->
			<section class="terms-section">
				<h2 class="terms-heading">7. Security measures</h2>
				<p>
					Numen implements appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your
					personal data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.
					These include encrypted communications (TLS/HTTPS), access controls, and regular
					security reviews. However, no transmission over the internet is completely secure, and
					we cannot guarantee absolute security.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- 8. COOKIES -->
			<section class="terms-section">
				<h2 class="terms-heading">8. Cookies</h2>
				<p>
					Our Website uses cookies and similar technologies to enhance your experience and
					collect analytical data. For detailed information about the cookies we use, their
					purposes, and how to manage your preferences, please refer to our Cookie Policy,
					available on the Website.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- 9. MINORS -->
			<section class="terms-section">
				<h2 class="terms-heading">9. Minors</h2>
				<p>
					Our Website and Services are directed exclusively at business professionals and
					organizations. We do not knowingly collect personal data from individuals under the age
					of 16. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such data, please contact us
					immediately at <strong>legal@numengames.com</strong>.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- 10. UPDATES -->
			<section class="terms-section">
				<h2 class="terms-heading">10. Updates to this policy</h2>
				<p>
					We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices or
					applicable law. Any updated version will be published on this page with a revised date.
					We encourage you to review this policy regularly. Continued use of the Website after
					publication of changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- 11. CONTACT -->
			<section class="terms-section">
				<h2 class="terms-heading">11. Contact</h2>
				<p>
					For any questions or requests relating to this Privacy Policy or the processing of your
					personal data, please contact us at:
					<strong>legal@numengames.com</strong>
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>

		<div class="terms-footer">
			<button type="button" id="privacy-close-btn" class="terms-button">
				Close
			</button>
		</div>
	</section>
</main>

<style>
	:global(body) {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: "Geist", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif !important;
	}

	.terms-root {
		min-height: 100vh;
		background-color: #05050f;
		color: #f4ead7;
		font-family: "Geist", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
		padding: 1.5rem;
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.terms-root {
			padding: 2rem 3rem;
		}
	}

	.terms-card {
		max-width: 960px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
		box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
		padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		height: 90vh;
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.terms-card {
			padding: 2rem 2.25rem;
		}
	}

	.terms-header {
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.terms-header {
			margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		}
	}

	.terms-title {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.terms-title {
			font-size: 1.875rem;
		}
	}

	.terms-meta {
		margin-top: 0.4rem;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: rgba(244, 234, 215, 0.7);
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.terms-meta {
			font-size: 0.9rem;
		}
	}

	.terms-scroll {
		flex: 1;
		overflow-y: auto;
		padding-right: 0.75rem;
		margin-right: -0.25rem;
		scrollbar-width: thin;
		scrollbar-color: rgba(244, 234, 215, 0.4) transparent;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.terms-scroll {
			font-size: 1rem;
		}
	}

	.terms-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {
		width: 6px;
	}

	.terms-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
		background: transparent;
	}

	.terms-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
		background-color: rgba(244, 234, 215, 0.4);
		border-radius: 999px;
	}

	.terms-section {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.terms-heading {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.terms-heading {
			font-size: 1.25rem;
		}
	}

	.terms-subheading {
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		margin: 1rem 0 0.35rem 0;
		color: #f4ead7;
	}

	p {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: rgba(244, 234, 215, 0.9);
	}

	.terms-list {
		margin: 0.25rem 0 0.75rem 1.25rem;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: disc;
		color: rgba(244, 234, 215, 0.9);
	}

	.terms-list li {
		margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
	}

	.terms-footer {
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: flex-end;
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.terms-footer {
			margin-top: 1rem;
		}
	}

	.terms-button {
		background: #1A1A1A;
		border: 1px solid #2A2A2A;
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		color: #ffffff;
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		font-family: "Geist", sans-serif;
		padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: all 0.3s;
		box-shadow: 0 0 20px 3px rgba(217, 184, 106, 0.35);
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.terms-button {
			font-size: 1rem;
			padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
		}
	}

	.terms-button:hover {
		box-shadow: 0 0 30px 6px rgba(217, 184, 106, 0.75);
	}
</style>

<script is:inline>
	const btn = document.getElementById("privacy-close-btn");

	if (btn) {
		btn.addEventListener("click", () => {
			if (window.parent) {
				window.parent.postMessage({ action: "close-privacy" }, "*");
			}
		});
	}
</script>
